4-D Warriors (c) 1985 Coreland / Sega.


A bizzare deep space shooter from Corel, which apparently has a 4th dimension. The game is a side scrolling shooter in which you take control of a jetpack propelled space warrior who travels between parallel universes and worm holes throughout the game. By flying over the top of the play field, you end up in an alternate universe.  You travel back and forth defeating enemies until you reach a boss creature. On some occasions a worm hole wil appear in the middle of the play field and you are taken to even stranger worlds...


