Super Special Graphic Designer : God Hand Kaihou, Magic Finger Koizumi, Beauty Arakawa, Dancing Inagaki, Hillkincho Minagawa, Monster Nozu, Spanish Onishi, Smoking Tada, Slow Hand Kurata, Uzzy, Shintoku

