$info=edrandy,edrandyj,edrandy1,
$bio

The Cliffhanger - Edward Randy (c) 1990 Data East.


A fast moving platform game in which the player controls the Indiana Jones-esque and unforunately named 'Edward Randy'. The levels are an inventive mix of standard platform action and 3-D scrolling levels; the latter usually having the player driving a jeep and repelling the enemy attacks. The game is based on the archtypial Hollywood action blockbuster and features a filmic score to back up the on-screen action. The player's only weapon is a whip - another nod to the Indiana Jones character - which can be used to both attack enemies and as a 'rope', to enable the player to reach distant platforms.


