Final Lap R (c) 1993 Namco.


The tenth game in Namco's seminal F1 series, which began eleven years' earlier with 1982's "Pole Position". Final Lap R features the same loose handling and demanding gameplay of its predecessors, but has the obligatory improved graphics, due to the more powerful host hardware. The game offers players a choice of four race tracks :

1. Germany

2. Brazil

3. Hungary

4. Belgium


