Gun.Smoke (c) 11/1985 Capcom.


A vertical action packed western game from the creators of "Commando (Capcom)".


- TECHNICAL -


Main CPU : Z80 (@ 4 Mhz)

Sound CPU : Z80 (@ 3 Mhz)

Sound Chips : (2x) YM2203 (@ 1.5 Mhz)


