In this vertical shoot'em up, you have five selectable characters who fight the big army of pirates but this time to collect elemental potions.


- TECHNICAL -


Main CPU : SH-2 (@ 28.63635 Mhz)

Sound Chips : YMF278B (@ 28.63635 Mhz)


