Intrepid (c) 1983 Nova Games.


- TECHNICAL -


Main CPU : Z80 (@ 3.072 Mhz)

Sound CPU : Z80 (@ 2.5 Mhz)

Sound Chips : (2x) AY8910 (@ 1.536 Mhz)


Screen orientation : Vertical

