PC [MS-DOS] (1988)

$end


$info=jdreddp,
$bio

Judge Dredd (c) 07/1992 Midway.


Here comes the judge! A beat-'em-up action based on the comics book of the same name.


- TECHNICAL -


Midway T Unit hardware


