The songs 'Get up Get up' and 'Hangtime - Whatcha Gonna Do' were produced by 'M.DOC of Indasoul Productions' specially for this game.


- TIPS AND TRICKS -


* Hidden Characters :

Dan Amrich - AMRICH / 2020 (Writer, SLAM magazine)

