Powered Gear - Strategic Variant Armor Equipment (c) 09/1994 Capcom.


An up-to-three players side-scrolling beat'em up game where four selectable mechs and their respective pilots try to save Earth from battle with a sister planet's renegade army. Parts of destroyed mechs can be outfitted onto your mech to create interesting and deadly combinations.


