1. R-Type (1987)

2. R-Type II (1989)

3. R-Type Leo (1992)

4. R-Type III - The 3rd Lightning (1994, Nintendo Super Famicom)

5. R-Type Delta (1999, Sony PlayStation)

6. R-Type Final (2004, Sony PlayStation 2)


