Hardware : Takashi Ohara (OHR)

Character designers : Fukio Mitsuji (MTJ), Taira Sanuki (T.S)

Sound : Hisayoshi Ogura (OGR)

Instraction : Naoko Yoshida (N.Y)

Story and game designer : Fukio Mitsuji (MTJ)


- PORTS -


