6. Real Bout Fatal Fury Special (1996)

7. Real Bout Fatal Fury 2 - The Newcomers (1998)

8. Fatal Fury Wild Ambition (1998)

9. Garou - Mark of the Wolves (1999)

10. Fatal Fury First Contact (1999, SNK Neo Geo Pocket Color)


