- SUPER 1 : Catch then Up, UpLeft, Left

- SUPER 2 : Catch then Up, UpLeft, Left then Catch


* BLACK WIDOW

- SUPER 1 : Catch then Down, Left, Up

- SUPER 2 : Catch then Down, Left, Up then Catch


