=> Leon > [A] Spread shot/Combat knife, [B] Power napalm

=> Angel > [A] Front shot/Tear gus, [B] Wide napalm

=> Lulu > [A] Wide shot/Revolver, [B] Normal bomb

=> Toy > [A] Laser shot/Stan gun, [B] Sonic bomb


