$bio

Skull & Crossbones (c) 11/1989 Atari Games.


Control one of two pirates (One-Eye or Red Dog), on a mission to retrieve their booty from the evil wizard. Collect treasures for points, and those ever famous hunks of meat for extra energy. This game gives you a choice of a path after each level, so there are many different paths to the ending.


- TECHNICAL -


Game ID : 136072


Main CPU : 68000 (@ 7.15909 Mhz), M6502 (@ 1.7895 Mhz)

