$info=sonofphx,
$bio

Son of Phoenix (c) 11/1985 Associated Overseas MFR.


An old generation shoot'em up.


- TECHNICAL -


Main CPU : (2x) Z80 (@ 4.608 Mhz)

Sound Chips : (2x) AY8910 (@ 1.5 Mhz)


Screen orientation : Vertical

Video resolution : 224 x 288 pixels

