13. Sonic N (2003, Nokia N-Gage)

14. Sonic Advance 3 (2004, Nintendo Game Boy Advance)

15. Sonic Heroes (2004, Nintendo Gamecube, Microsoft Xbox, Sony Playstation 2)


- STAFF -


Programmer : Yuji Naka

Staff : Naoto Oshima


- PORTS -


* Consoles :

Sega Game Gear (1991)

Sega Master System (1991)

Sega Mega Drive (1991)

$end


