$bio

Soul Calibur (c) 07/1998 Namco.


- TECHNICAL -


Namco System 12 hardware

Game ID : SOC


Main CPU : SPU (@ 16.9344 Mhz), H8/3002 (@ 14.7456 Mhz)

Sound Chips : C352 (@ 14.7456 Mhz)


