Nintendo Famicom (1987)

Sony PlayStation 2 (2004, "Tecmo Hit Parade")

Microsoft XBOX (2005, "Tecmo Classic Arcade")


* Computers :

Sharp X68000 (1984)

MSX (1985)

$end


