Producer : Iyono Pon


* Voice Actors :

Ryu, Charlie : Toshiyuki Morikawa

Chun-Li : Yuko Miyamura

Ken Masters, Guy : Tetsuya Iwanaga

Adon, Birdie, Sodom : Wataru Takagi

Rose : Yuko Miyamura

