- STAFF -


Game designed by : John R. Newcomer (JRN)

Software by : Thomas N. Deaux (TND), Wayne P. Breivogel (WPB)

Graphic art by : Chris L. Simmons (CLS), Jill Chittenden (JIL)

$end


