$bio

V-Five (c) 12/1992 Toaplan.


- TECHNICAL -


Game ID : TP-027


Main CPU : 68000 (@ 10 Mhz)

Sound Chips : YM2151 (@ 3.375 Mhz)


Screen orientation : Vertical

Video resolution : 240 x 320 pixels

Aspect Ratio : 3/4

Screen refresh : 59.41 Hz

Palette Colors : 2048


Players : 2

Control : 8-way joystick

