Vindicators (c) 04/1988 Atari Games.


- TECHNICAL -


Game ID : 136059


Main CPU : 68010 (@ 7.15909 Mhz), M6502 (@ 1.7895 Mhz)

Sound Chips : YM2151 (@ 3.579 Mhz), POKEY (@ 1.7895 Mhz)


