- TRIVIA -


This game is an official licensed product of the NHL (National Hockey League) and the NHLPA (National Hockey League Players Association).


During the match, you can see in the background adverts for 'Coca-Cola', 'Upper Deck', 'Campbell's' and 'Chunky'.


Wayne Douglas Gretzky was born in Canada on january 26, 1961. He began playing organized hockey at the age of 6. He entered the WHA (World Hockey Association) on June 12 1978 and the NHL the following year. Winning 57 trophy and cups in all his career, Gretzky retired from the NHL in 1999. In his last game versus the Pittsburgh Penguins on April 29th 1999, he recorded his 2857th point in his 1487th game.


